<title>RUSSIA: Russia defence minister likely to cancel UAE trip.</title>
<headline>Russia defence minister likely to cancel UAE trip.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian Defence Minister Igor Rodionov is unlikely to go ahead with a planned visit to an international arms exhibition in the United Arab Emirates on March 16-20, a ministry spokesman said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The spokesman did not say whether the probable cancellation of the trip was linked to a government reshuffle, ordered by President Boris Yeltsin on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Rodionov's job is considered by the Russian media to be on the line after Yeltsin criticised the minister for his public remarks about the poor state of the army.</p>
